   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hm not sure if that does the trick...<div>I dont want to display something, but rather get sever user inputs into JavaScript. The sending back from the stuff happening in JavaScript to the App is no problem. Its rather that the JavaScript side cannot handle multiple changes, made to the same Object...</div><div><br></div><div>Isnt there a way to &quot;collect&quot; the changes (made in the App) in JavaScript? Whenever something changes in the App, update the JavaScript that relies on the values coming from the app. Something like observe() in shiny... That works when its only one callbackhandler, but not with &quot;nested&quot; ones...</div></div>"
    ],
    [
